[重构思路] 统一 dump 选项并显式化策略：对外展示/落库的路径如需保持原有形状，应显式 exclude_none；同时让 v1 路径复用同一套选项。代码示例：
```python
def _serialize_pydantic(obj: BaseModel, max_length, max_items, *, exclude_none: bool = True):
    serialized = obj.model_dump(exclude_none=exclude_none)
    return {k: serialize(v, max_length, max_items) for k, v in serialized.items()}
```

[重构思路] 在 dict 序列化时显式规范化键，并保持与 value 一致的截断策略。代码示例：
```python
def _serialize_dict(obj: dict, max_length, max_items) -> dict:
    return {
        (k if isinstance(k, str) else str(serialize(k, None, None))): serialize(v, max_length, max_items)
        for k, v in obj.items()
    }
```

